{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人离开了曾让他受委屈、却也给过他亲近与自在的熟悉生活。离开后，他在孤单、怀念和自我保护之间反复摇摆，最后决定既承认过去的美好，也记住受过的伤害，不再委屈自己，继续把日子过好。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后空落迷茫\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念自在又记着委屈\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近回忆甜苦交杂\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼亲近又疑离开错\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"不该忍委屈却已疲惫\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"想念亲近又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后孤单仍不愿忍\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"回忆带来短暂喘息\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"想亲近还是怕孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"不能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"念亲近却忘不了委屈\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"害怕仍在但继续向前\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近与委屈都记得\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"不吞委屈地过好日子\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S08-S12，停留时间短，几个相似的问题反复出现，容易把想念亲近和害怕孤单混在一起，也不容易马上听出人物态度的变化。最抓人的是 S07 到 S13：离开后的孤单突然变得具体，而最后既不否认曾经的温暖，也不再否认受过的委屈，终于形成了有力量的情感收束。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "afd1d1c5-d776-470a-854b-b233581c3b9e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185731954511Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:58:09.877755+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4e56b012b1f99280599a34b7436f93a50ee3373b4500d6dc8420af0eb521e60e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185731954511Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4afb47dee82deb53c6fa53f85fc5b952c8e5cfc3472ad28ded57103f6a3fe10a"}}}
